            <ArticleTitle>Painful unilateral epileptic seizure.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>414-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two rare cases with focal, paroxysmal pain as the initial manifestation of partial epilepsy have been reported. The pain attacks subsided after treatment with anti-epileptic drugs.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
